OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies three weeks after
OL,4,A'unexplained' injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died three weeks after
OL,7,Fsuffering "unexplained" injuries in
OL,8,FHereford, according to police.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Great Western
OL,11,FWay, between Sainsbury's and Hunderton
OL,12,FBridge at about 05:00 BST on 31 August.
OL,14,FWest Mercia Police said the "injuries
OL,15,Fcontinue to be treated as unexplained
OL,16,Fand an investigation continues".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
