OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies three weeks after
OL,4,A'unexplained' injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after the man was found, Det
OL,7,FCh Insp Edward Slough, said: "We are
OL,8,Fkeeping an open mind as to how the man
OL,9,Fsustained his injuries, but we do not
OL,10,Fbelieve there is any wider risk to the
OL,11,Fpublic."
